cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "The Spectra Pointer"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A cross-match database and search tool that unifies stellar spectroscopy
  holdings across dozens of independent astronomical archives (ESO, SDSS,
  Gaia, LAMOST, Keck/KOA, Gemini, and more) behind a single Gaia DR3
  source_id lookup.
authors:
  - family-names: Way
    given-names: Zachary
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0179-9662"
    affiliation: "Department of Physics and Astronomy, Georgia State University"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/zachway/spectra_pointer"
url: "https://spectra-pointer-997472993697.us-central1.run.app"
